"entity": {
"name": "Airtel Africa Plc",
"description": "Airtel Africa Plc provides telecommunications and mobile money services. It operates through the following business lines: Mobile Voice, Mobile Data and Airtel Money. The Mobile Voice business provides pre-and post-paid wireless voice services, international roaming, fixed-line telephone services and interconnect revenue paid to the Group by other telecommunications providers. The Mobile Data business comprises of data communications services and other value added services for mobile subscribers. The Airtel Money business comprises a mobile commerce service that is accessible through customers mobile devices. The firm's geographical segments include Nigeria, East Africa, and Francophone Africa. The company was founded on July 12, 2018 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
